# Lines to ADD to the speculoos crontab on appct for shadow mode. Nothing existing changes: the nightly
# cron lines keep doing the work, and the queue only records what it would do, in its own database under
# mh_scratch. Times are appct local time (Europe/London), as for the existing lines.
#
#   watchdog  every 5 min    keep one shadow dispatcher running (it never launches anything)
#   watch     every 30 min   one ESO watcher poll, 11:00-23:30 local (10:00-22:30 UTC in BST)
#   lookback  21:15 daily    the 30-night look-back, after the nightly window
#   report    07:30 daily    mh_scratch/appct-job-queue/shadow/reports/shadow_<date>.md
#
# --- orchard job queue: SHADOW MODE (records decisions only; the lines above still do the work) ---
*/5 * * * * /export/data/SPECULOOSPipeline/mh_scratch/appct-job-queue/src/jobqueue/cron/queue-cron.sh --shadow watchdog
*/30 11-23 * * * /export/data/SPECULOOSPipeline/mh_scratch/appct-job-queue/src/jobqueue/cron/queue-cron.sh --shadow watch
15 21 * * * /export/data/SPECULOOSPipeline/mh_scratch/appct-job-queue/src/jobqueue/cron/queue-cron.sh --shadow lookback
30 7 * * * /export/data/SPECULOOSPipeline/mh_scratch/appct-job-queue/src/jobqueue/cron/queue-cron.sh --shadow report
